OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after 'metal pins' found
OL,4,Ain Halloween sweets
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo mothers have spoken of their shock
OL,7,Fafter discovering metal pins hidden
OL,8,Finside sweets collected by their young
OL,9,Fchildren while trick-or-treating.
OL,11,F"If he had have swallowed that, he
OL,12,Fwould be sitting in hospital right now
OL,13,Fand it would've been a completely
OL,14,Fdifferent story," Samantha Bingham
OL,15,Fsaid, after finding a metal needle
OL,16,Finside a chocolate bar collected by her
OL,17,Feight-year-old son.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
