OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after 'metal pins' found
OL,4,Ain Halloween sweets
OL,5,
OL,6,FSavannah McDaid said she was shocked to
OL,7,Fdiscover four "metal pins embedded" in
OL,8,Fsweets collected by her three-year-old
OL,9,Fson after they returned home from
OL,10,Ftrick-or-treating together.
OL,12,FThe incidents are being investigated by
OL,13,Fpolice, with parents being warned to
OL,14,Finspect any remaining sweets collected
OL,15,Fover Halloween.
